## Visual Studio / .NET Ignore rules

# Build results & binaries
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
[P3]ublish/

# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code cache & user-specific settings
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.user
*.userossc
*.sln.docstates
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svclog

# NuGet packages & restore artifacts
*.nupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

# Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
